{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（21日）清晨5時半左右，警方接獲觀塘翠屏北邨翠梓樓一名姓嚴女住戶（47歲）報案，指其單位起火。消防員到場將火救熄，報案人的胞姐手部燒傷，送院治理，事件中約40名居民自行疏散。</p><p>警方稱，初步調查顯示單位的風扇短路釀成火警。48歲姓嚴女住戶，救火期間燒傷手，送到聯合醫院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員到場將火救熄。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156126555769278464830742.jpeg/4xVlMVB6laNDR3SeGz56QKHzqRwCNfWSun47Fbp-OxU\"/><figcaption>消防員到場將火救熄。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員到場將火救熄。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156126553143513088576821.jpeg/d2nYP6QREFDyKJqpq5LZmkPUJYMU2KUSdJscT3SbHE8\"/><figcaption>消防員到場將火救熄。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"單位疑風扇短路引起火警。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156126547451580416653417.jpeg/EvMwASy99e8GuRLxqGFqmbR9DMQ12H8NwMKrXcDCq10\"/><figcaption>單位疑風扇短路引起火警。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"單位疑風扇短路引起火警。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156126558432792576752104.jpeg/9essk04ulZ70InZAywVyUDsWirXoWZt1Yv4uFmL-LhY\"/><figcaption>單位疑風扇短路引起火警。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T00:39:52.746965+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}